      "difficulty_level": "H2",
      "difficulty_reason": "The author encodes commutation through device signatures, constructs a free effectful category with the required centrality conditions, and proves the resulting free construction turns a signature-level commuting tensor into the universal commuting tensor of categories. The proof uses an explicit adjunction and restriction/uniqueness arguments for commuting cospans. These constructions go beyond ordinary trace monoid identities; the full unit/counit support and diagrams remain present. Only Theorem47 is counted; freeness and other support are not split.",
